{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43058","headline":"过睦州青溪渡 · 杨彝","name":"过睦州青溪渡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天阔衔江雨，冥冥上客衣。\n潭清鱼可数，沙晚鴈争飞。\n川谷留云气，鹈鹕傍钓矶。\n瓢零江海客，欹侧一帆归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨彝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}